  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote responsive recovery and handling of Mercury from contaminated tailings and riverbends in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To promote responsible recovery and handling of mercury from contaminated tailings and riverbeds in Colombia through identifying the most environmentally responsible techniques and to make progress in the development, adoption and implementation of recommendations for improved poicies and technical protocols to safely store and dispose of mercury from contaminated tailings and/or riverbeds.</narrative>
  </description>
